## Avoid total silence

Tinnitus is often more noticeable when it is quiet. Have soft background sound, such as a radio, fan or sound app.

## Sleep

Try a sound generator, pillow speaker or relaxing music at bedtime. Keep regular sleep times.

## Stress

Stress can make tinnitus seem louder. Relaxation, exercise and mindfulness can help.

## Protect your hearing

Use **ear protection** in noisy places, keep music volume down, and take breaks from noise.

## Support

**Tinnitus UK** has a free helpline, online support and local groups.
